{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12377","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12377/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12377/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12377/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12377","id":3143733996,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc67YZLs","number":12377,"title":"Streamlining Terminal Command Approval in GitHub Copilot Agent Mode","user":{"login":"kolinabir","id":108505956,"node_id":"U_kgDOBnerZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108505956?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir","html_url":"https://github.com/kolinabir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kolinabir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-13T14:16:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:57:40Z","closed_at":"2025-12-12T20:57:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Streamlining Terminal Command Approval in GitHub Copilot Agent Mode\n\nThe current manual approval for every Copilot-suggested terminal command creates workflow friction and interruptions.\n\n---\n\n## Key Requirements\n\n### Configurable Auto-Approval Policies\n\nAllow users to define rules such as:\n\n* **Whitelist/Blacklist**: Specify commands or patterns to always auto-approve or always require manual approval.\n* **Regex Patterns**: Use regular expressions for flexible command matching.\n* **Contextual Approval**: Define rules based on the current project, directory, or active file.\n* **Command Categories**: Auto-approve commands belonging to specific groups like `git` or `npm`.\n\n### User Interface\n\n* **Integrated Settings**: Seamlessly integrate all auto-approval settings into the IDE (e.g., VS Code) for easy access and management.\n* **Intuitive UI**: Provide a clear interface for adding, editing, and deleting rules, including **import/export functionality** for configurations.\n* **Toggle Button**: Include a dedicated **toggle button beside the chat input** to quickly enable or disable the auto-approval feature.","closed_by":{"login":"bhavyaus","id":25044782,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQ0Nzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25044782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus","html_url":"https://github.com/bhavyaus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bh